Feature: What a team sees
  A team sees 150 m round each of its drones, in the air or on the ground. It sees 150 m round
  its base, and 200 m round each tower that it holds. Each team has a map of its own. The map
  shows the enemy drones that the team sees, where they are now. All the rest of the field is
  in [[fog]].

  When an enemy drone goes into the fog, the map keeps it where the team last saw it. The map
  shows it dim, with the time since then. The map of a team also shows each tower as the team
  last saw it. Thus a tower in the fog can change sides, and your map does not show it.

  Expectation: A team sees an enemy drone near one of its drones
    Given the Red scout is near a Blue drone
    When the game runs for 10 seconds
    Then the Red scout on the Blue map is seen

  Expectation: A team sees an enemy drone near a tower that it holds
    Given the Red scout is near the Blue home tower
    When the game runs for 10 seconds
    Then the Red scout on the Blue map is seen

  Expectation: A team does not see an enemy drone in the fog
    Given the Red scout is far from anything Blue
    When the game runs for 10 seconds
    Then the Red scout on the Blue map is unknown

  Expectation: An enemy drone that goes into the fog stays where the team last saw it
    Given the Red scout is near a Blue drone
    When the Red scout flies into the fog for 10 seconds
    Then the Red scout on the Blue map is last seen
    And the age of the Red scout on the Blue map is 10 s

  Expectation: A tower in the fog shows the side it had when the team last saw it
    Given the east tower is neutral
    And the control of the east tower is -90 %
    And the Red drones in the east circle are 1
    When the game runs for 10 seconds
    Then the east tower is held by Red
    And the east tower on the Blue map is neutral

  Expectation: A team sees the side of a tower again when its drone comes near
    Given the east tower is held by Red
    And the east tower on the Blue map is neutral
    When a Blue drone flies near the east tower
    Then the east tower on the Blue map is held by Red
